{"4744810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abandoned Hospital Patrol", "steam_appid": 4744810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[NOTICE]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game was created as part of Byking Inc.'s new employee training program. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depending on your PC environment, the game may not function properly or unexpected issues may occur. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A keyboard and mouse or controller is required to play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■PRECAUTIONS &amp; DISCLAIMER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains horror elements and scenes with loud sounds. Players who are young, have heart conditions, or are sensitive to intense experiences should refrain from playing. This game is a work of fiction. Any organizations, characters, or other entities appearing in this game are fictional and have no relation to any real-world organizations or individuals. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned Hospital Patrol is a 3D horror game where you search an abandoned hospital for buttons missing from a child's puzzle game and find a way out... while something relentlessly pursues you from the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While on a security patrol at a hospital undergoing relocation, you discover a mysterious diary left behind by a child in Room 313, a room excluded from your assigned route. After leaving the room, you find the hospital transformed into a dark and unsettling place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/cbed2fe65389b21e61b90d0f9eadc02a.poster.avif?t=1787712690\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/cbed2fe65389b21e61b90d0f9eadc02a.webm?t=1787712690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/cbed2fe65389b21e61b90d0f9eadc02a.mp4?t=1787712690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Horror, Exploration and Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the missing buttons needed to complete the puzzle and find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/c9c115d1818ee979e8accc490adacfc3.poster.avif?t=1787712690\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/c9c115d1818ee979e8accc490adacfc3.webm?t=1787712690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/c9c115d1818ee979e8accc490adacfc3.mp4?t=1787712690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Find the Buttons Before Something Finds You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no weapons to defend yourself, your only option is to run. Search the hospital for the buttons while something stalks the halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/bcaccd7d474c047628487193a9552110.poster.avif?t=1787712690\" width=674 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/bcaccd7d474c047628487193a9552110.webm?t=1787712690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/bcaccd7d474c047628487193a9552110.mp4?t=1787712690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Memories Hidden Within a Mysterious Diary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the hospital are pages from a mysterious diary left behind by a child. Collecting them will slowly reveal the events of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/cce8dc6aa69c3b7cf520ab33df70de3e.poster.avif?t=1787712690\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/cce8dc6aa69c3b7cf520ab33df70de3e.webm?t=1787712690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744810/extras/cce8dc6aa69c3b7cf520ab33df70de3e.mp4?t=1787712690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[NOTICE]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game was created as part of Byking Inc.'s new employee training program. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depending on your PC environment, the game may not function properly or unexpected issues may occur. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A keyboard and mouse or controller is required to play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■PRECAUTIONS &amp; DISCLAIMER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains horror elements and scenes with loud sounds. Players who are young, have heart conditions, or are sensitive to intense experiences should refrain from playing. This game is a work of fiction. Any orga